{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/518451-thank-you","id":518451,"title":"Thank you","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-05-18T15:03:22-07:00","id":518451,"title":"Thank you","content":"I got my copy of W:tF 2ed in mail today! Its soo beautiful (yeah, I got the premium edition)! I just want to thank Stew Wilson and the team of writers for making it possible at last. I've been dreaming and waiting patiently for this day to come and at long last I have my awesome copy in my hands. I am truly grateful to you guys for all of your hard work and devotion to W:tF. The new style, the new mechanics, and the game itself are amazing--it's just what W:tF needed. Thanks to you guys my friends and I will be having a great time this summer with the game. Again from the bottom of my heart, thank you soo much! A toast to Stew Wilson and the team! Cheers!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2360-cecoyotl","name":"Cecoyotl","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2360_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"207"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-18T15:29:33-07:00","id":518513,"title":"","content":"Hey, my PoD copy just arrived in the mail today as well! Awesome!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","