rk is fantastic. Thank you Stew and the rest of the team at Onyx Path. Keep up the amazing work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5700-nuwisha-nutjob","name":"Nuwisha Nutjob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5700_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-22T02:51:10-07:00","id":524195,"title":"","content":"I got both (one premium and one normal) a few days back. And I live in Norway! So Im pretty happy about it.<br /> <br /> the books look great, and Im happy to have them both. There was not a lot of difference between premium and normal tho. Pretty similar aside from paper?<br /> <br /> In either case: thanks Onyx Path and all you awsemoe writers! The books will get a lot of use here.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/860-ephraim","name":"Ephraim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar860_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}